---

This project downloads FFmpeg binaries at runtime. FFmpeg is a separate
project, licensed under the LGPL/GPL depending on the build. The binaries
fetched by default come from the ffmpeg-static distribution
(https://github.com/eugeneware/ffmpeg-static, GPL-3.0-or-later builds based on
gyan.dev's "essentials" build) and are **not** distributed with this package.
If you redistribute anything that bundles those binaries, you take on the
corresponding license obligations yourself.
